"uploaded","size":827,"digest":"sha256:7ce665f5e2a7504aa121cf4c87479d9e0c81c6a83328b72b8d2887c00ed8d9b4","download_count":1043,"created_at":"2026-10-05T02:05:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T02:05:09Z"},{"id":611190707,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84kbgez","name":"latest.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":350,"digest":"sha256:017eeb2ecbe8d94577cf3e3aba37b02c3fad8de39f69fdf876d3cfcc7736ef89","download_count":3199,"created_at":"2026-10-05T01:57:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T01:57:03Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 新增 Qwen Code、Kimi Code、CodeBuddy、Qoder、GitHub Copilot 和 ZCode，接入聊天、群聊及工作流；Qoder 使用全局模式，其余五种也支持独立配置模型 (#3280)\n- Ekko 会话在历史和搜索中归入内置 Agent，并支持 `/context`、`/usage`、`/status` 和 `/compact` 命令 (#3276)\n- 新建聊天默认选择 Ekko，直接展示已安装 Agent，避免 CLI 探测；重新打开未发送的聊天不再等待不存在的历史消息 (#3284、#3288)\n- 完善编程 Agent 按原生能力传递图片输入，并支持 Windows 下的长文本和多行提示词 (#3285)\n- 完善 Windows Agent 运行依赖检查和 ZCode 桌面 CLI 识别，修复含空格或非 ASCII 字符路径的启动问题 (#3281)\n- 修复 Copilot 通过 Responses API 流式调用工具时参数不完整的问题，并补齐 custom 工具兼容性，解决 GPT 模型发送图片时返回 `400 Unsupported Chat Completions tool: custom` 的问题 (#3286、#3289)\n- 修复 Claude 在 root 环境中的免确认工具执行，并统一全局和独立模式启动权限 (#3287)\n- 移除已停用的 OpenCode Free 供应商及其模型入口 (#3277)\n- 前端 changelog 仅保留最近三个版本，清理更早版本的更新记录及全部对应国际化文本 (#3289)\n\n## What's Changed\n* feat(studio): introduce built-in Ekko chats and agent catalog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3276\n* [codex] remove retired OpenCode Free provider by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3277\n* [codex] add six native coding agents with scoped model support by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3280\n* [codex] default chats to Ekko and avoid CLI probes during creation by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3284\n* [codex] support coding agent images and Windows long prompts by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3285\n* [refactor] isolate coding agents and harden Windows launches by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3281\n* [codex] fix Copilot streamed tool argument JSON by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3286\n* fix(coding-agents): launch Claude with IS_SANDBOX permission bypass by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3287\n* [codex] avoid history loading for unsent chats by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3288\n* [codex] release 0.7.30 and fix Copilot custom tool requests by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3289\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.29...v0.7.30","mentions_count":2}
